WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:03.562
Welcome to the Green Team Observer orientation.

00:00:03.562 --> 00:00:07.075
Follow the team record and exercise state without creating,

00:00:07.075 --> 00:00:10.350
editing, forwarding, or submitting artifacts.

00:00:10.350 --> 00:00:13.600
Use this guide to build situational awareness without crossing into

00:00:13.600 --> 00:00:15.325
participant authority.

00:00:15.325 --> 00:00:18.812
Follow the record from live context to artifacts, incoming

00:00:18.812 --> 00:00:21.150
information, and the timeline.

00:00:21.150 --> 00:00:23.913
At every stop, distinguish what you can inspect from

00:00:23.913 --> 00:00:26.475
what an active seat is permitted to change.
